te Virtual em realidade aumentada ou modo texto, diretamente durante as li\u00e7\u00f5es em realidade virtual.\n\nEsse assistente est\u00e1 sempre dispon\u00edvel para responder perguntas sobre os conte\u00fados das aulas e tamb\u00e9m sobre os produtos do Grupo Plan Marketing, oferecendo suporte inteligente a qualquer momento do treinamento. Uma tecnologia criada para tornar o aprendizado mais acess\u00edvel, din\u00e2mico e envolvente.", "short_description": "Conhe\u00e7a o Assistente Virtual com IA da VRSchool."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_VRschool.png", "id": "1471508504488603", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604298355_1471508507821936_1033407612722260786_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YoxEg7jnO1cQ7kNvwHrww_E&_nc_oc=Adp7Tt213GpvIejo3SkE9LDFL_-2oWxSRItGxBEH_-PtIHW64HD3wNonypTAJqlPxZ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af80aJwRz-wctOQLa04quyjkesloXpWz2AM5XQuzFwRQbA&oe=6A393223"}, {"file_name": "logo_VRSCHOOL.png", "id": "1449776713259284", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1449776716592617_1673567406847786742_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CcOCssw315gQ7kNvwFxLB4u&_nc_oc=AdrzGuYBW06Ohx2vdEZGhD_C9qYffUhZPYuLFjxgrLa6jAFRS-gchCjvaWrGXh7QmUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-dzMtcvfeJonixzQIxM0X6spfGWu5mTCadBZDpv6X4fg&oe=6A393A29"}, {"file_name": "icone_512x512.png", "id": "1278444900874844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825415_1278444904208177_5391998273224680991_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ql_nhJXl1cIQ7kNvwGizXHL&_nc_oc=AdrHDl-eXsL-f5DXorkf97WpvHFyppn4C35-1VBUmIC-6YtyV8Mi6hlvIwLjRYkVeQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8SzPtN9-CcCir88eO4YGwh83Qbfue4hgcv7tP-4Eu0PA&oe=6A3942